最後バリバリなのもまずいよねー
That "baribari" at the very end was crazy too!

641
00:47:44,027 --> 00:47:46,027
最後バリバリじゃないだろ！
It wasn't "baribari" at the end!

642
00:47:46,027 --> 00:47:48,527
あ、最後ガオ、ガオってことだよ！
Ah, I meant it went "Gao! Gao!" at the end!

643
00:47:48,527 --> 00:47:51,527
そうだよ！がおーって言っただろ、お前！
Right! You yelled "Gao-!", you dummy!

644
00:47:51,527 --> 00:47:54,527
もうさっきの記憶なくなってるやん！
You've already lost your memory from just a moment ago!

645
00:47:54,527 --> 00:47:57,527
間違えちゃった！はい、で、そのあとが？
I made a mistake! Okay, and what came after that?

646
00:47:57,527 --> 00:47:59,527
はい、LiVE DiVEですね！
Yes, it was "LiVE DiVE"!

647
00:47:59,527 --> 00:48:03,027
よかったよー！熱かった！
That was great! It was so hype!

648
00:48:03,027 --> 00:48:06,527
そしてわたくし、Intersection、AZKiちゃんの曲ですけど
And then me with "Intersection", AZKi-chan's song,

649
00:48:06,527 --> 00:48:09,527
AZKiちゃんの曲の中で一番好きかも
which might be my absolute favorite among AZKi-chan's songs.

650
00:48:09,527 --> 00:48:11,327
名曲！名曲！最高や！
Masterpiece! Masterpiece! The absolute best!

651
00:48:11,327 --> 00:48:14,027
そして最後がマガマガで！
And lastly, with MagaMaga—

652
00:48:14,027 --> 00:48:16,527
「スキスキDieスキ超Ayeシテル」
"Suki Suki Die Suki Choo Aishiteru"!

653
00:48:16,527 --> 00:48:19,027
ちょっと難しかったねー！
That was pretty difficult!

654
00:48:19,027 --> 00:48:21,027
よかった！可愛かった！
It was great! So cute!

655
00:48:21,027 --> 00:48:25,027
船長って歌が上手なんだなってすごい思いました
It really made me realize just how amazingly Senchou sings.

656
00:48:25,027 --> 00:48:28,527
改めて先輩たちへのね、尊敬が生まれました
Once again, it renewed our deep respect for our seniors.

657
00:48:28,527 --> 00:48:32,527
リスペクト！歌わせていただいてありがとうございます！
Respect! Thank you so much for letting us sing your songs!

658
00:48:32,527 --> 00:48:37,527
はい！ということで、ここからは嬉しいお知らせとなります！
Yes! And so, from here we have an exciting announcement!

659
00:48:37,527 --> 00:48:39,527
こちらをご覧ください！はい、ドーン！
Please take a look at this! Here we go, bam!

