おおー！ / 来た！ / 来る？ / 来た来た来た！
Ooh! / It's here! / Is it coming? / Here it comes, here it comes!

741
00:53:26,168 --> 00:53:30,168
うわー！ / おー、来ましたー！
Whoa! / Oh, it's here!

742
