(ever lasting love me...)

753
00:54:16,668 --> 00:54:22,168
(ever lasting love you...)

754
00:54:22,668 --> 00:54:26,168
女の子は魔法使い
Girls are magical witches,

755
00:54:26,168 --> 00:54:29,668
神様がくれた悪戯（プレゼント）
a playful gift from God.

756
