胸の中を駆け巡る ギルティ！
race through my heart—so guilty!

762
00:54:54,968 --> 00:54:58,368
だってそばにいてほしいから
Because I just want you by my side,

763
00:54:58,368 --> 00:55:00,168
メロがる呪文...#めろぞーまっ
I cast the bewitching spell... #Melozoma!

764
00:55:01,216 --> 00:55:04,016
とろけちゃって love you ずっとずっと
Melt away, love you forever and ever

765
00:55:04,016 --> 00:55:07,716
頭の中ハートいっぱいになって
My head gets completely full of hearts

766
00:55:07,716 --> 00:55:10,016
ほら もっともっと
Look, more and more

767
00:55:10,016 --> 00:55:13,916
釘付けになれ めろぞーまっ
Be totally captivated, #Mellowzoma!

768
00:55:14,716 --> 00:55:19,216
Ever lasting love me...

769
