Ever lasting love you...

770
00:55:25,616 --> 00:55:28,416
レディファーストってなんかいや
I don't really like "ladies first"

771
00:55:28,416 --> 00:55:32,016
私ファーストが絶対です
"Me first" is an absolute must!

