時間も感情だって独占させて Fall in love
let me monopolize your time and feelings, fall in love

774
00:55:38,216 --> 00:55:41,216
カラフルだけどトゲ張って
Colorful yet covered in prickles,

775
00:55:41,216 --> 00:55:45,416
こんぺいとうみたいなこの純情を
like konpeito candy, this pure heart of mine

