(永遠になんて) 空想だけど願いたいの
("Forever" is) just a fantasy, but I still want to wish for it

792
00:56:48,016 --> 00:56:51,216
そんな魔法があればいいのに…
If only such magic really existed...

793
00:56:51,216 --> 00:56:54,216
切ないけど
It aches, but...

794
00:56:54,216 --> 00:56:57,216
素直になりたい めろぞーまっ
I want to be true to my heart, #Mellowzoma!

795
00:56:57,216 --> 00:57:00,416
唱えたいな love you ずっとずっと…
I want to chant it: love you forever and ever...

796
00:57:00,416 --> 00:57:03,216
(こんなにもキミに、恋してるから。)
(Because I've fallen so deeply in love with you.)

797
00:57:03,216 --> 00:57:06,216
離れたくない hug you もっともっと
I don't want to part, hug you more and more

798
00:57:06,216 --> 00:57:09,716
想い愛したい めろぞーまっ
I want to cherish and love you, #Mellowzoma!

799
00:57:09,716 --> 00:57:13,016
とろけちゃって love you ずっとずっと
Melt away, love you forever and ever

800
00:57:13,016 --> 00:57:16,716
頭の中 ハート充満になって
My head becomes overflowing with hearts

801
00:57:16,716 --> 00:57:19,216
ほら もっともっと
Look, more and more

802
00:57:19,216 --> 00:57:22,716
釘付けになれ めろぞーまっ
Be totally captivated, #Mellowzoma!

803
00:57:22,716 --> 00:57:25,216
解けないで とっておきの魔法
Don't ever break, my special magic

804
00:57:25,216 --> 00:57:28,416
クラクラさせてやる メルティ
I'll make your head spin, melty!

805
00:57:28,416 --> 00:57:31,616
いつまでも 私だけ見てて
Keep your eyes on only me forever

806
00:57:31,616 --> 00:57:34,616
唱える めろぞーまっ
I chant it: #Mellowzoma!

807
00:57:34,616 --> 00:57:37,716
解かないで とっておきの呪文
Don't ever dispel my special spell

808
00:57:37,716 --> 00:57:41,216
ドキドキしてたいの メルシィ
I want my heart to keep racing, merci!

809
00:57:41,216 --> 00:57:44,216
いつまでも 私を愛してね
Love me forever and always, okay?

810
00:57:44,216 --> 00:57:47,216
唱える めろぞーまっ
I chant it: #Mellowzoma!

811
00:57:47,216 --> 00:57:51,016
イチコロね めろぞーまっ
Totally head over heels, #Mellowzoma!

